Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 08:49:05 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] 2114: a time-of-day greeting is answered in kind (switch OFF,
 for Misho's yes)
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Box 54162 (Lika's point): „დილა მშვიდობისა" and „საღამო მშვიდობისა" got
„გამარჯობა". With MIRRORED_GREETING_ON the server greeting opens with the
person's own words („დილა მშვიდობისა, ნინო! რით დაგეხმარო?"); en/ru/es
alike; a plain hello and the import line are unchanged. Georgian is never
upper-cased (it would turn Mtavruli). USER-VISIBLE: OFF until Misho's yes.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01HwFREQwL5g9E6qRrUf9bau
